' BIZOMAT CAD Automation for SOLIDWORKS: starts the add-in inside SOLIDWORKS (it is not the add-in itself).
' Tools > Macro > Run this file, or give it a button (Tools > Customize > Commands > Macro).
' It needs OpenSketchSW.exe > Install for me once (no admin rights).
Dim gOpenSketch As Object

Sub main()
    On Error GoTo failed
    Set gOpenSketch = CreateObject("OpenSketch.Sw.Launcher")
    gOpenSketch.Start Application.SldWorks
    Exit Sub
failed:
    MsgBox "BIZOMAT CAD Automation is not installed for this Windows user. Install BIZOMAT CAD Automation for SOLIDWORKS, or run OpenSketchSW.exe and click Install for me." & vbCrLf & Err.Description, vbExclamation, "BIZOMAT CAD Automation"
End Sub
